{"seq":1,"slug":"ar-vs-diffusion-paradigm","title":"自回归与扩散范式对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/foundations/ar-vs-diffusion-paradigm","wordCount":1703,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"自回归与扩散范式对比\">自回归与扩散范式对比</h1><p>ChatGPT 吐字时那种一个词一个词蹦出来的节奏，不是产品设计，而是数学决定的：自回归模型把生成一段文本严格定义为「给定已写出的所有词，预测下一个词」的连续抉择。扩散语言模型挑战的正是这个被当成天经地义的前提——它问，为什么一定要从左到右？能不能先模糊地把整段话铺出来，再反复修订成清晰的成品？这一篇不碰任何扩散公式，只把两种世界观的根本差异、各自的代价与红利摆清楚。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>两种范式的分歧，本质是对「如何分解一段文本的联合概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x_1, \\dots, x_L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>」给出了不同答案。自回归用概率的链式法则，把联合概率精确拆成从左到右的条件概率乘积：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>L</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>L</mi></munderover><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∣</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(x_1, \\dots, x_L) = \\prod_{i=1}^{L} p(x_i \\mid x_1, \\dots, x_{i-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个分解是数学恒等式，没有任何近似——代价是它强行规定了一个生成顺序。扩散则不做这种因式分解，而是引入一条「加噪—去噪」的轨迹：先定义一个把干净文本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 逐步破坏成纯噪声 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的前向过程，再训练模型学会反向的去噪，从噪声一步步恢复出文本。生成时不指定先写哪个词，而是让所有位置在多轮迭代中协同浮现。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[一段文本的联合概率 p_x] --&gt; B[自回归: 链式法则精确分解]&#10;    A --&gt; C[扩散: 加噪-去噪轨迹建模]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[从左到右逐 token 条件概率]&#10;    B1 --&gt; B2[生成顺序固定&lt;br/&gt;每步只产出一个 token]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[整段并行&lt;br/&gt;多轮迭代精炼]&#10;    C1 --&gt; C2[生成顺序自由&lt;br/&gt;每步可改多个位置]&#10;    B2 --&gt; D[各有代价与红利]&#10;    C2 --&gt; D\">flowchart TD\n    A[一段文本的联合概率 p_x] --&gt; B[自回归: 链式法则精确分解]\n    A --&gt; C[扩散: 加噪-去噪轨迹建模]\n    B --&gt; B1[从左到右逐 token 条件概率]\n    B1 --&gt; B2[生成顺序固定&lt;br/&gt;每步只产出一个 token]\n    C --&gt; C1[整段并行&lt;br/&gt;多轮迭代精炼]\n    C1 --&gt; C2[生成顺序自由&lt;br/&gt;每步可改多个位置]\n    B2 --&gt; D[各有代价与红利]\n    C2 --&gt; D</pre><p>下表把两种范式在关键维度上的对照一次性列清，后文逐项展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>自回归（AR）</th>\n<th>扩散（Diffusion）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>概率分解</td>\n<td>链式法则，精确</td>\n<td>变分下界（ELBO），近似</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生成顺序</td>\n<td>固定从左到右</td>\n<td>任意、可并行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单次前向产出</td>\n<td>1 个 token</td>\n<td>整段（多个位置）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>推理步数</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 步（序列长度）</td>\n<td>可调，通常远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KV 缓存</td>\n<td>天然适配，复用充分</td>\n<td>双向注意力，难复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>填空/编辑</td>\n<td>需特殊机制</td>\n<td>天然支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>似然评估</td>\n<td>直接、精确</td>\n<td>上界、需近似</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"链式法则的红利与枷锁\">链式法则的红利与枷锁</h2><p>自回归之所以统治了 LLM，是因为链式法则带来的工程红利极其丰厚。第一，它的训练目标干净到无可挑剔：用因果掩码让每个位置只看左侧，一次前向就能并行计算所有位置的下一词预测损失，这就是 GPT 系列的预训练核心（详见 <a href=\"../../llm-fundamentals/pretraining-and-alignment/pretraining-objectives\">预训练目标</a>）。第二，它的似然是精确的，给定文本可以直接算出概率，评估困惑度毫无歧义。第三，推理时已生成的前缀不会变，键值对可以缓存复用，这就是 KV 缓存高效的根基。</p>\n<p>但同一套机制也是枷锁。固定的生成顺序意味着模型一旦写错一个词，没有回头修正的机制——后续只能在错误前提上继续。推理必须严格串行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 步，序列多长就要多少次前向，这是自回归延迟的根本来源。而且因为只能看左侧上下文，做填空、补全中段这类需要双向信息的任务时，自回归得靠特殊训练或重排输入才能勉强应付。</p>\n<h2 id=\"去噪轨迹的红利与代价\">去噪轨迹的红利与代价</h2><p>扩散范式恰好在自回归的痛点上反击。因为它建模的是整段文本的协同恢复，生成顺序完全自由：模型可以先确定它最有把握的若干位置，把它们当作锚点，再逐轮填充其余位置。这种「先易后难、反复修订」的方式天然适合需要全局一致性的任务，也让单次前向能并行确定多个 token，从而把推理步数从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 压到一个可调的较小值——这正是 Mercury 在 H100 上跑出每秒上千 token 的机制来源，详见 <a href=\"../capabilities/parallel-decoding-sampling\">并行解码与采样</a>。</p>\n<p>代价同样真实。扩散无法像链式法则那样精确分解联合概率，只能优化一个变分下界（ELBO），这让它的似然评估变成「上界」而非确切值，对比困惑度时必须格外小心，详见 <a href=\"../practice/benchmarks-vs-ar\">与自回归的对比评测</a>。它的双向注意力与因果掩码不兼容，导致 KV 缓存难以直接复用，这是扩散 LLM 推理优化的核心难题。此外，多数扩散模型生成前要先确定序列长度，不如自回归那样自然地「写到 EOS 为止」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为何文本扩散比图像扩散晚熟\">为何文本扩散比图像扩散晚熟</h2><p>值得追问的是：图像扩散 2020 年就大放异彩，文本扩散为何拖到 2024 年后才追上？根源在数据的离散性。图像像素是连续值，往上加一点高斯噪声仍是有意义的图像，连续扩散的整套微积分工具直接适用（这套工具属于 <a href=\"../../diffusion-models/\">扩散模型</a> hub 的范畴）。文本是离散符号，「在 token 上加一点噪声」根本无从定义——把「猫」加 0.1 的噪声并不会得到「介于猫和狗之间」的词。</p>\n<p>于是文本扩散必须先解决「如何在离散空间定义加噪与去噪」这个前置问题，这就是后续 <a href=\"discrete-diffusion-basics\">离散扩散基础</a> 要讲的内容。学界给出的两类答案——要么直接在离散符号空间定义跳变过程（催生了 D3PM、SEDD），要么把 token 投到连续嵌入空间借用图像那套工具（催生了 Diffusion-LM）——构成了本 hub 架构章的三条路线。理解了这个离散性障碍，你就能理解为何扩散 LLM 的每一项技术选择，归根结底都在回答「怎样在不连续的文本上重现连续扩散的优雅」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>自回归用链式法则把文本概率精确分解为从左到右的条件概率链；扩散用加噪—去噪轨迹建模整段文本，不指定生成顺序。</li>\n<li>自回归的红利是精确似然、并行训练、KV 缓存友好；枷锁是固定顺序、串行 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span> 步推理、难做填空。</li>\n<li>扩散的红利是任意顺序、并行解码、天然填空与全局规划；代价是似然只有变分上界、KV 缓存难复用、常需预定长度。</li>\n<li>文本扩散晚熟的根因是数据离散性——无法直接加高斯噪声，必须先解决「离散空间如何定义扩散」，这导向了本 hub 后续的三条架构路线。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>离散性障碍的数学解法：<a href=\"discrete-diffusion-basics\">离散扩散基础</a></li>\n<li>扩散能并行解码的能力兑现：<a href=\"../capabilities/parallel-decoding-sampling\">并行解码与采样</a></li>\n<li>似然对比的陷阱：<a href=\"../practice/benchmarks-vs-ar\">与自回归的对比评测</a></li>\n<li>跨库：自回归的链式法则与预训练目标见 <a href=\"../../llm-fundamentals/pretraining-and-alignment/pretraining-objectives\">LLM 预训练目标</a></li>\n<li>跨库：连续扩散的母体理论见 <a href=\"../../diffusion-models/foundations/ddpm\">扩散模型基础 DDPM</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自回归与扩散范式对比","id":"自回归与扩散范式对比"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"链式法则的红利与枷锁","id":"链式法则的红利与枷锁"},{"level":2,"text":"去噪轨迹的红利与代价","id":"去噪轨迹的红利与代价"},{"level":2,"text":"为何文本扩散比图像扩散晚熟","id":"为何文本扩散比图像扩散晚熟"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"离散扩散基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/diffusion-language-models/foundations/discrete-diffusion-basics"}}